WEBVTT

1
00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:14.291
Now here in these four 
verses of the sixth chapter,

2
00:01:14.291 --> 00:01:15.750
Lord Krishna describes

3
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:19.250
the supreme state of a meditation yogi.

4
00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.750
This is the state of samadhi,

5
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.125
where the yogi becomes completely free

6
00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:26.166
from the senses, from materialism, 
and from sorrows,

7
00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:28.375
and remains completely

8
00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:29.458
established in

9
00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:32.750
their spiritual form.

10
00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:39.250
These four verses

11
00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:40.583
describe the highest

12
00:01:40.583 --> 00:01:42.833
state of yoga.

13
00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:43.958
First,

14
00:01:43.958 --> 00:01:45.333
in the twentieth verse,

15
00:01:45.333 --> 00:01:46.416
Lord Krishna explains

16
00:01:46.416 --> 00:01:49.458
that through the discipline 
of continuous yoga practice,

17
00:01:49.458 --> 00:01:50.250
a person

18
00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:51.750
can completely control

19
00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.625
their mind.

20
00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:54.583
And in such a controlled

21
00:01:54.583 --> 00:01:55.541
state,

22
00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:57.083
all material obstacles

23
00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:59.291
and desires end,

24
00:01:59.291 --> 00:02:02.625
and a yogi, becoming introspective,

25
00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:05.791
focuses their attention
 completely on Paramātmā.

26
00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:08.458
But this is not just a state of being away

27
00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:11.458
from the external world and materialism.

28
00:02:11.458 --> 00:02:12.125
Rather,

29
00:02:12.125 --> 00:02:12.833
it's a state

30
00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:15.958
of realization of one's pure spiritual form.

31
00:02:15.958 --> 00:02:18.416
And they attain the infinite satisfaction

32
00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:21.458
of completely understanding 
their spiritual form.

33
00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:23.875
This satisfaction is unimaginable,

34
00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:26.291
which no material thing can give.

35
00:02:26.291 --> 00:02:28.125
After this, in the twenty-first verse,

36
00:02:28.125 --> 00:02:30.625
Lord Krishna says that beyond material senses,

37
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:33.250
once this highest level

38
00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.333
of happiness is attained,

39
00:02:35.333 --> 00:02:37.916
then the yogi remains stable in this.

40
00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:41.583
From this state, they are never disturbed again.

41
00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:43.500
Material pleasures are momentary –

42
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.458
here today, gone tomorrow.

43
00:02:45.458 --> 00:02:47.958
But the joy of this state of yoga

44
00:02:47.958 --> 00:02:49.083
is permanent,

45
00:02:49.083 --> 00:02:50.666
because it doesn't depend

46
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:52.458
on any external thing.

47
00:02:52.458 --> 00:02:54.958
In this state, the yogi has found

48
00:02:54.958 --> 00:02:58.333
such a source of infinite bliss within themselves

49
00:02:58.333 --> 00:03:00.958
that whatever changes happen outside,

50
00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:04.333
they are never disturbed by them.

51
00:03:04.333 --> 00:03:06.958
Once this experience happens,

52
00:03:06.958 --> 00:03:09.000
they are never attracted

53
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.083
toward material cravings again,

54
00:03:11.083 --> 00:03:12.750
because they know

55
00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:16.375
this is the supreme truth and supreme bliss.

56
00:03:16.375 --> 00:03:19.166
There's nothing beyond this.

57
00:03:19.166 --> 00:03:22.166
This has been called the state of samadhi.

58
00:03:22.166 --> 00:03:25.541
Then in the twenty-second verse,
 Lord Krishna explains

59
00:03:25.541 --> 00:03:26.375
that once

60
00:03:26.375 --> 00:03:28.416
a yogi has attained

61
00:03:28.416 --> 00:03:30.291
this state of samadhi,

62
00:03:30.291 --> 00:03:32.791
then even the biggest crisis of the world,

63
00:03:32.791 --> 00:03:34.166
or any sorrow,

64
00:03:34.166 --> 00:03:36.875
cannot harm the yogi.

65
00:03:36.875 --> 00:03:40.250
Whether there's material loss, or physical pain

66
00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.666
or mental stress,

67
00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:44.125
these don't disturb the yogi either,

68
00:03:44.125 --> 00:03:46.708
because now their complete consciousness

69
00:03:46.708 --> 00:03:49.708
is centered in their higher spiritual truth.

70
00:03:49.708 --> 00:03:50.875
And then in the twenty-third verse,

71
00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:52.708
Lord Krishna says

72
00:03:52.708 --> 00:03:55.416
that in this state of yoga, a person becomes

73
00:03:55.416 --> 00:03:58.500
completely free from all material sufferings.

74
00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.375
This is that true liberation –

75
00:04:00.375 --> 00:04:01.375
when a person

76
00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:03.958
goes beyond all sorrows arising from

77
00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:06.666
worldly attachments.

78
00:04:06.666 --> 00:04:09.541
Now the yogi considers neither
 this material body as their existence,

79
00:04:09.541 --> 00:04:12.333
nor this restless mind.

80
00:04:12.333 --> 00:04:13.916
This is that state

81
00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:14.666
where the yogi knows

82
00:04:14.666 --> 00:04:18.083
only the soul as their existence,

83
00:04:18.083 --> 00:04:20.666
which is infinite, imperishable.

84
00:04:20.666 --> 00:04:22.375
And if this body

85
00:04:22.375 --> 00:04:24.916
and this materialism have no existence,

86
00:04:24.916 --> 00:04:28.958
then how does the question 
of any material suffering arise?

87
00:04:28.958 --> 00:04:31.250
This is the supreme purpose of yoga –

88
00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:33.208
liberation from the sufferings of this world,

89
00:04:33.208 --> 00:04:35.291
and completely establishing a connection

90
00:04:35.291 --> 00:04:37.916
with one's spiritual form.

91
00:04:37.916 --> 00:04:40.333
We must remember once again

92
00:04:40.333 --> 00:04:43.583
that the real meaning of yoga 
is not physical exercise

93
00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:45.666
or just freedom from stress.

94
00:04:45.666 --> 00:04:47.625
Rather, its real meaning is

95
00:04:47.625 --> 00:04:49.708
connecting with your spiritual truth.

96
00:04:49.708 --> 00:04:52.333
And only one who has connected with this truth

97
00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:55.708
will be able to connect with Paramātmā too.

98
00:05:00.375 --> 00:05:02.666
Think about it –

99
00:05:02.666 --> 00:05:06.833
about the supreme state of yoga,

100
00:05:06.833 --> 00:05:08.875
where a yogi is

101
00:05:08.875 --> 00:05:13.583
completely free from all material sufferings.

102
00:05:13.583 --> 00:05:18.000
Where there is only and only infinite bliss.

103
00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.291
To hear, this may seem

104
00:05:19.291 --> 00:05:23.208
unbelievable to some –

105
00:05:23.208 --> 00:05:27.333
but meet a perfected yogi,

106
00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:31.583
you'll know the truth yourself. And even better,

107
00:05:31.583 --> 00:05:36.250
try walking on the path of yoga yourself.

108
00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:39.125
Maybe not the supreme state,

109
00:05:39.125 --> 00:05:41.583
but just by including yoga in your life,

110
00:05:41.583 --> 00:05:46.250
you'll start seeing positive effects.

111
00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.375
And from this, your faith in yoga

112
00:05:49.375 --> 00:05:52.000
will automatically increase.

113
00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.666
Firmness and faith in life

114
00:05:54.666 --> 00:05:57.750
come only from personal experience.

115
00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:58.958
When a yogi

116
00:05:58.958 --> 00:06:02.333
sees transformation in their life through yoga,

117
00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:03.958
their faith in yoga practice

118
00:06:03.958 --> 00:06:06.416
becomes unbreakable.

119
00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:11.500
Their very perspective of 
seeing the world changes.

120
00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:14.125
If difficulties come,

121
00:06:14.125 --> 00:06:17.708
now that yogi doesn't panic. Because

122
00:06:17.708 --> 00:06:20.458
they know from their past experience

123
00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:23.708
that this difficulty is momentary,

124
00:06:23.708 --> 00:06:27.416
and if they keep control over the mind

125
00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:29.958
and continue the practice of yoga,

126
00:06:29.958 --> 00:06:32.625
this difficulty will pass.

127
00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:35.583
So in a way, their experience itself

128
00:06:35.583 --> 00:06:39.083
starts guiding them now.

129
00:06:39.083 --> 00:06:42.333
Remember, change in life doesn't come just

130
00:06:42.333 --> 00:06:46.708
by reading some principle or knowledge.

131
00:06:46.708 --> 00:06:50.458
Yes, gaining knowledge is essential,

132
00:06:50.458 --> 00:06:52.541
because this is the first step,

133
00:06:52.541 --> 00:06:55.791
but to bring true change in life,

134
00:06:55.791 --> 00:06:58.875
you must adopt it

135
00:06:58.875 --> 00:07:02.375
and follow its principles with discipline.

136
00:07:02.375 --> 00:07:06.541
Therefore, keep acquiring spiritual knowledge,

137
00:07:06.541 --> 00:07:08.125
but at the same time,

138
00:07:08.125 --> 00:07:10.625
practice spirituality too,

139
00:07:10.625 --> 00:07:14.416
make it a part of your daily life.

140
00:07:14.416 --> 00:07:17.500
Through the practice of yoga and spirituality,

141
00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.375
not only will your life transform,

142
00:07:20.375 --> 00:07:23.000
but you yourself will also start

143
00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.458
inspiring others toward this path.

144
00:07:26.458 --> 00:07:28.291
Think about it.

145
00:07:32.875 --> 00:07:33.750
In the supreme

146
00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:37.166
state of yoga, a yogi

147
00:07:37.166 --> 00:07:42.416
rises above all troubles and sorrows.

148
00:07:42.416 --> 00:07:44.541
No problem of the world

149
00:07:44.541 --> 00:07:47.041
can disturb them.

150
00:07:47.041 --> 00:07:49.666
In this state, there is only

151
00:07:49.666 --> 00:07:53.791
infinite peace and bliss.

152
00:07:53.791 --> 00:07:57.208
Such is the power of spirituality.

153
00:07:57.208 --> 00:07:59.625
When your family also leans

154
00:07:59.625 --> 00:08:01.250
toward spirituality,

155
00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:04.541
positive changes start appearing

156
00:08:04.541 --> 00:08:06.750
not only in personal life

157
00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:10.208
but also in family relationships.

158
00:08:10.208 --> 00:08:13.750
As this experience deepens,

159
00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:17.541
faith also becomes stronger.

160
00:08:17.541 --> 00:08:20.333
And the more this faith increases,

161
00:08:20.333 --> 00:08:24.833
the more the family's spiritual 
progress will also grow.

162
00:08:24.833 --> 00:08:28.500
Remember, the tree whose roots are deep

163
00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:29.666
remains stable

164
00:08:29.666 --> 00:08:33.416
in its place even in storms.

165
00:08:33.416 --> 00:08:34.583
Similarly,

166
00:08:34.583 --> 00:08:37.500
where the roots of spirituality are strong,

167
00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:41.208
no difficulty will be able to shake that family.

168
00:08:41.208 --> 00:08:43.500
In such a family, there will be such depth

169
00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:47.208
of mutual cooperation and love

170
00:08:47.208 --> 00:08:49.666
that no disagreement

171
00:08:49.666 --> 00:08:50.875
will be able to stand before it.

172
00:08:50.875 --> 00:08:53.125
But to walk on this path,

173
00:08:53.125 --> 00:08:55.750
don't wait for anyone else.

174
00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:59.083
You take the first step, and when the family

175
00:08:59.083 --> 00:09:01.125
sees the change in you,

176
00:09:01.125 --> 00:09:03.666
they will be encouraged themselves.

177
00:09:03.666 --> 00:09:07.583
Then holding their hand, 
move them forward too.

178
00:09:07.583 --> 00:09:11.375
Imagine such a family where

179
00:09:11.375 --> 00:09:13.416
everyone is practicing yoga

180
00:09:13.416 --> 00:09:16.041
and studying scriptures,

181
00:09:16.041 --> 00:09:19.250
and through this spiritual power,

182
00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:23.500
they are progressing in 
personal and collective life.

183
00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:27.291
Come, let's walk on the path of yoga and Gita

184
00:09:27.291 --> 00:09:30.916
taking our family along.

185
00:09:35.875 --> 00:09:38.666
In the supreme state of yoga,

186
00:09:38.666 --> 00:09:41.375
on one hand is the removal of sufferings,

187
00:09:41.375 --> 00:09:46.041
and on the other is also 
the experience of infinite bliss.

188
00:09:46.041 --> 00:09:50.541
But the secret to reaching this state

189
00:09:50.541 --> 00:09:52.916
is a yogi's unwavering faith

190
00:09:52.916 --> 00:09:55.916
and continuous practice.

191
00:09:55.916 --> 00:09:58.458
This state is not attained

192
00:09:58.458 --> 00:10:00.166
by just a few days of effort –

193
00:10:00.166 --> 00:10:02.333
continuous yoga practice,

194
00:10:02.333 --> 00:10:05.083
new experiences, and the faith
 awakened from them

195
00:10:05.083 --> 00:10:08.666
are what move the yogi forward.

196
00:10:08.666 --> 00:10:12.708
Professional life is also somewhat like this.

197
00:10:12.708 --> 00:10:15.500
For progress, it's essential that you gain new

198
00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:19.375
experiences and have faith in yourself.

199
00:10:19.375 --> 00:10:20.291
Just as a yogi

200
00:10:20.291 --> 00:10:22.916
holds faith firmly on their journey,

201
00:10:22.916 --> 00:10:27.083
similarly you too must face new experiments

202
00:10:27.083 --> 00:10:30.666
and challenges with faith.

203
00:10:30.666 --> 00:10:33.833
Many times we fear new experiments,

204
00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:38.791
we think "what if we fail?"

205
00:10:38.791 --> 00:10:42.875
This very fear becomes an 
obstacle to your progress.

206
00:10:42.875 --> 00:10:44.000
Think –

207
00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:47.250
if a bird never takes flight

208
00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.958
for fear of falling,

209
00:10:48.958 --> 00:10:51.958
it will never experience the joy of flying.

210
00:10:51.958 --> 00:10:54.541
If your experiment succeeds,

211
00:10:54.541 --> 00:10:56.875
your confidence will increase.

212
00:10:56.875 --> 00:11:00.000
And even if the experiment fails,

213
00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.083
this experience will increase your wisdom.

214
00:11:03.083 --> 00:11:05.958
Every experience gives some learning

215
00:11:05.958 --> 00:11:08.541
that makes you stronger,

216
00:11:08.541 --> 00:11:11.000
brings you closer to success.

217
00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:14.583
One who stops before fear

218
00:11:14.583 --> 00:11:17.458
will never reach the destination.

219
00:11:17.458 --> 00:11:21.208
One who keeps walking with dedication and faith

220
00:11:21.208 --> 00:11:23.500
will attain their goal.

221
00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:29.333
So just keep walking with dedication and faith.
